            <div>
              <dt>Who it serves</dt>
              <dd>The event describes itself as welcoming vaulters across a very wide age range. 2027 registration is already live.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Registration</dt>
              <dd>$75 plus processing fee through December 1, 2026; $100 plus processing fee after that. Registration is scheduled to close January 8, 2027 at 9:00 p.m. ET. Pole rental is advertised through The Pole Drop.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Why AZPVA might care</dt>
              <dd>A destination-style winter competition, useful for youth, open, and masters athletes who want an outdoor meet early in the year.</dd>
            </div>
